# Fishing Pole: the equipped Memnite has "{1}, {T}, Tap Fishing Pole: Put a bait counter on Fishing Pole" (CR 613.1f, 602.2,
# 118.3). Bot1 activates it on turn 3: the Memnite and the Pole are both tapped and the Pole has a bait counter. On turn 5
# both untap, and "whenever equipped creature becomes untapped, remove a bait counter ... If you do, create a 1/1 blue Fish"
# (CR 701.26b, 603.2) removes the bait and makes the Fish.

